  "question": {
    "text": "A non–conducting ring of radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> having uniformly distributed charge <math><mi>Q</mi></math> starts rotating about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>–</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></math> axis passing through diameter with an angular acceleration <math><mi>α</mi></math>, as shown in the figure. Another small conducting ring having radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is kept fixed at the centre of bigger ring is such a way that axis <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>xx</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></math> is passing through its centre and perpendicular to its plane. If the resistance of small ring is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>,</mo></math> find the induced current in it in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ampere</mi></math>.<br />\r(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>0.1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0003_7a2e487142aa.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 137px;\" />"
  },
